## Privacy & Security

- **Zero data collection** — nothing leaves your device
- **No tracking** — no analytics, no telemetry
- **No accounts** — no sign-up, no login
- **CSP enforced** — Content Security Policy blocks unauthorized requests
- **Referrer Policy** — `no-referrer` on all requests
- **Local-first** — internet is optional, never required

